  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 1000,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Setup Notes",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "datasource", "uid": "-- Mixed --" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "id": 1001,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "code": { "language": "plaintext", "showLineNumbers": false, "showMiniMap": false },
        "content": "This is a **fleet-wide overview** across all tenants — no selectors, since the point is to see everything at once. For a per-tenant/per-connector drill-down (processing time, cache hit rates, error rates), use the main **Dynamic Mapper — Observability** dashboard.\n\n**This service runs with `isolation: MULTI_TENANT`**: every replica/pod serves every subscribed tenant — tenants are not pinned to one instance. Two consequences for this dashboard: (1) **`dynmapper_build_info` (Deployed Version) has no `tenant` label and applies to the whole fleet**, not a specific tenant — if more than one version shows, a rollout is in progress and it affects all tenants equally, not a chosen few. (2) Per-tenant gauges (cache sizes, connector status) are reported **independently by every replica**, so every query here aggregates them with `max by (tenant, ...)` before display — without that, a multi-replica deployment would produce one row per (tenant × replica) and break the tables into extra, seemingly-duplicated columns.\n\n**Tenant Overview** table is derived from `dynmapper_inbound_inventory_cache_size` et al. — these gauges are created unconditionally for every tenant at subscription time (before any connector is configured or message flows) and removed on unsubscribe, making them the most reliable \"is this tenant currently deployed here\" signal available.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.0.0",
      "title": "",
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "id": 10,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Fleet Overview",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "blue", "value": null }] },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 7 },
      "id": 11,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.0.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "count(count by (tenant) (dynmapper_inbound_inventory_cache_size)) or vector(0)",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "active tenants",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Active Tenants",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "Deduplicated across replicas (a connector reported by 3 pods still counts once).",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "blue", "value": null }] },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 7 },
      "id": 12,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.0.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "count(max by (tenant, connectorName, connectorType) (dynmapper_connector_status)) or vector(0)",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "connectors configured",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Total Connectors Configured",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "Fleet-wide — not scoped to one tenant. Deduplicated across replicas. Alert on this being > 0.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 1 }] },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 7 },
      "id": 13,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.0.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "count(max by (tenant, connectorName, connectorType) (dynmapper_connector_status) == 7) or vector(0)",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "failed connectors",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Connectors Currently FAILED (fleet-wide)",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "Fleet-wide — this gauge has no tenant label (MULTI_TENANT isolation means every tenant shares the same running instances). More than one tile means a rollout is in progress. Requires the dynmapper_build_info metric — see Setup Notes.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "blue", "value": null }] },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 7 },
      "id": 14,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": true },
        "textMode": "name"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.0.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "count by (version) (dynmapper_build_info)",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "{{version}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Deployed Version(s)",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 13 },
      "id": 20,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Tenant Overview",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "One row per currently-subscribed tenant. Absence from this table means the tenant is not subscribed, or was unsubscribed and its metrics aged out. All counts are deduplicated across replicas, so a multi-pod deployment still shows one row per tenant.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "mappings": [],
          "noValue": "0",
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Connectors FAILED" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "custom.cellOptions", "value": { "type": "color-background" } },
              { "id": "thresholds", "value": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 1 }] } }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byRegexp", "options": "Inbound Msgs/sec|Outbound Msgs/sec" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "unit", "value": "msgs/sec" }]
          }
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "id": 21,
      "options": {
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [{ "displayName": "Tenant", "desc": false }]
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.0.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "count by (tenant) (max by (tenant, connectorName, connectorType) (dynmapper_connector_status))",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "Connectors Configured",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "count by (tenant) (max by (tenant, connectorName, connectorType) (dynmapper_connector_status) == 7)",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "Connectors FAILED",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "max by (tenant) (dynmapper_inbound_identity_cache_size)",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "Inbound Identity Cache Size",
          "refId": "C"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "max by (tenant) (dynmapper_outbound_identity_cache_size)",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "Outbound Identity Cache Size",
          "refId": "D"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "max by (tenant) (dynmapper_inbound_inventory_cache_size)",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "Inventory Cache Size",
          "refId": "E"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "sum by (tenant) (rate(dynmapper_inbound_message_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "Inbound Msgs/sec",
          "refId": "F"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "sum by (tenant) (rate(dynmapper_outbound_message_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "Outbound Msgs/sec",
          "refId": "G"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "sum by (tenant) (dynmapper_mapping_count{direction=\"INBOUND\"})",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "Inbound Mappings",
          "refId": "H"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "sum by (tenant) (dynmapper_mapping_count{direction=\"OUTBOUND\"})",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "Outbound Mappings",
          "refId": "I"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "labelsToFields",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "joinByField",
          "options": { "byField": "tenant", "mode": "outer" }
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true, "Time 1": true, "Time 2": true, "Time 3": true, "Time 4": true,
              "Time 5": true, "Time 6": true, "Time 7": true, "Time 8": true,
              "Time #A": true, "Time #B": true, "Time #C": true, "Time #D": true, "Time #E": true,
              "Time #F": true, "Time #G": true, "Time #H": true, "Time #I": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "tenant": 0,
              "Connectors Configured": 1,
              "Connectors FAILED": 2,
              "Inbound Identity Cache Size": 3,
              "Outbound Identity Cache Size": 4,
              "Inventory Cache Size": 5,
              "Inbound Msgs/sec": 6,
              "Outbound Msgs/sec": 7,
              "Inbound Mappings": 8,
              "Outbound Mappings": 9
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "tenant": "Tenant",
              "Value #A": "Connectors Configured",
              "Value #B": "Connectors FAILED",
              "Value #C": "Inbound Identity Cache Size",
              "Value #D": "Outbound Identity Cache Size",
              "Value #E": "Inventory Cache Size",
              "Value #F": "Inbound Msgs/sec",
              "Value #G": "Outbound Msgs/sec",
              "Value #H": "Inbound Mappings",
              "Value #I": "Outbound Mappings",
              "Value": "Connectors Configured",
              "Value 1": "Connectors FAILED",
              "Value 2": "Inbound Identity Cache Size",
              "Value 3": "Outbound Identity Cache Size",
              "Value 4": "Inventory Cache Size",
              "Value 5": "Inbound Msgs/sec",
              "Value 6": "Outbound Msgs/sec",
              "Value 7": "Inbound Mappings",
              "Value 8": "Outbound Mappings"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "filterFieldsByName",
          "options": {
            "exclude": { "pattern": "^Value( .*|#.*)?$" }
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "Tenants",
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 24 },
      "id": 30,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Connectors",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "One row per (tenant, connector), deduplicated across replicas. Status column: 0=UNKNOWN, 1=CONFIGURED, 2=ENABLED, 3=CONNECTING, 4=CONNECTED, 5=DISCONNECTED, 6=DISCONNECTING, 7=FAILED, 8=RETRYING.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "mappings": [
            { "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "UNKNOWN", "color": "text", "index": 0 } } },
            { "type": "value", "options": { "1": { "text": "CONFIGURED", "color": "blue", "index": 1 } } },
            { "type": "value", "options": { "2": { "text": "ENABLED", "color": "blue", "index": 2 } } },
            { "type": "value", "options": { "3": { "text": "CONNECTING", "color": "yellow", "index": 3 } } },
            { "type": "value", "options": { "4": { "text": "CONNECTED", "color": "green", "index": 4 } } },
            { "type": "value", "options": { "5": { "text": "DISCONNECTED", "color": "red", "index": 5 } } },
            { "type": "value", "options": { "6": { "text": "DISCONNECTING", "color": "orange", "index": 6 } } },
            { "type": "value", "options": { "7": { "text": "FAILED", "color": "red", "index": 7 } } },
            { "type": "value", "options": { "8": { "text": "RETRYING", "color": "orange", "index": 8 } } }
          ],
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Status" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "custom.cellOptions", "value": { "type": "color-background" } }]
          }
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 25 },
      "id": 31,
      "options": {
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [{ "displayName": "Tenant", "desc": false }]
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.0.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "max by (tenant, connectorName, connectorType) (dynmapper_connector_status)",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "labelsToFields",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": { "Time": true, "__name__": true, "application": true, "instance": true },
            "renameByName": {
              "tenant": "Tenant",
              "connectorName": "Connector",
              "connectorType": "Type",
              "Value": "Status"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "Connector Status by Tenant",
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 34 },
      "id": 50,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Mappings",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "One row per (tenant, direction, transformation type) that has ever been registered for a subscribed tenant — zero counts are shown explicitly, not hidden. Counts are live, deduplicated across replicas. Legacy transformation types (DEFAULT, SUBSTITUTION_AS_CODE) are deprecated; expect them to taper to zero.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "mappings": [],
          "noValue": "0",
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 35 },
      "id": 51,
      "options": {
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.0.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "max by (tenant, direction, transformationType) (dynmapper_mapping_count)",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "labelsToFields",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": { "Time": true, "__name__": true, "application": true, "instance": true },
            "renameByName": {
              "tenant": "Tenant",
              "direction": "Direction",
              "transformationType": "Transformation Type",
              "Value": "# Mappings"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "Mapping Counts by Tenant, Direction & Transformation Type",
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 44 },
      "id": 40,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Activity by Tenant",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "continuous-GrYlRd" },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] },
          "unit": "msgs/sec"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 45 },
      "id": 41,
      "options": {
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "showUnfilled": true
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.0.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "sum by (tenant) (rate(dynmapper_inbound_message_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "{{tenant}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Inbound Messages/sec by Tenant",
      "type": "bargauge"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "continuous-GrYlRd" },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] },
          "unit": "msgs/sec"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 45 },
      "id": 42,
      "options": {
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "showUnfilled": true
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.0.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "sum by (tenant) (rate(dynmapper_outbound_message_total[$__rate_interval]))",
